### 필수값 누락
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_type": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "provider_email": "test3@example.com",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 201 Pass
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_type": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "provider_email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 409 이미 존재하는 계정
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_type": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "provider_email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 501 아직 구현되지 않은 기능
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_type": "PHOTOGRAPHER",
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "provider_token": "",
  "nickname": "tester"
}
